{"_type":"issue","id":"esi-8we","title":"Scorecard: enable Branch-Protection on master (0/10)","description":"Reason: 'branch protection not enabled on development/release branches'. Enable a branch protection rule / ruleset on master: require PR before merge, require status checks (ci-fast, ci), require at least 1 approving review, dismiss stale approvals, no force-push. GitHub settings change (admin). Also raises the Code-Review score. See https://docs.github.com/repositories/configuring-branches-and-merges-in-your-repository/managing-protected-branches","notes":"Applied via GitHub API: require PR + required checks (Quality Gate, Lint/Build/Test), strict up-to-date, no force-push, no required approvals (solo maintainer), admins not enforced.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"chore","owner":"lgriffin@redhat.com","created_at":"2026-08-24T09:10:52Z","created_by":"Leigh Griffin","updated_at":"2026-08-24T09:40:17Z","closed_at":"2026-08-24T09:40:17Z","close_reason":"Closed","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"esi-8we","depends_on_id":"esi-q5z","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-08-24T10:10:54Z","created_by":"Leigh Griffin","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":1,"comment_count":0}
{"_type":"issue","id":"esi-jxu","title":"Scorecard: fix Token-Permissions (0/10)","description":"Reason: 'detected GitHub workflow tokens with excessive permissions'. All workflows have top-level permissions, but these grant WRITE at top level: ci.yml (pull-requests: write), nightly-audit.yml (issues: write), nightly-spec-drift.yml (issues: write), release-please.yml (contents: write, pull-requests: write). Fix: keep top-level 'contents: read' (or {}) and move each write scope down to the specific job that needs it. Quick, code-only win.","notes":"Merged in PR #197.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"chore","owner":"lgriffin@redhat.com","created_at":"2026-08-24T09:10:52Z","created_by":"Leigh Griffin","updated_at":"2026-08-24T09:53:03Z","started_at":"2026-08-24T09:34:56Z","closed_at":"2026-08-24T09:35:36Z","close_reason":"Closed","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"esi-jxu","depends_on_id":"esi-q5z","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-08-24T10:10:54Z","created_by":"Leigh Griffin","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
